The Software and its Contributions are provided without any express or implied warranty. Under no circumstances shall any Contributor or copyright holder be liable to anyone for direct or indirect losses arising from use of the Software or its Contributions, regardless of the cause or legal theory, even if advised of the possibility of such losses.

