## Article 13. Interpretation of Article 12

If the preceding disclaimer and limitation of liability are not supported under local law, the appellate court shall apply the local legal rule that most closely approximates the waiver of civil liability concerning this Program, unless the Program is accompanied by a paid warranty or an undertaking of liability.

------

