By copying, downloading, modifying, compiling, running, or Distributing the Software or a Modified Version, the Recipient is deemed to have read, understood, and agreed to all terms of this License.

If the Recipient does not agree to any term of this License, the Recipient may not exercise any right granted under it or copy, modify, run, or Distribute the Software or a Modified Version.

